---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { aiPlan, ddSteps, sampleUrl, updatedLabel } from '../lib/data';

const path = '/ai-due-diligence';
const updated = updatedLabel(path);
---
<Base path={path}>
<div>
<div style="padding:clamp(48px,7vw,80px) clamp(20px,4vw,60px) clamp(40px,5vw,60px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(21,22,15,.14)">
<div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:30px"><div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:#8a5a3c">01 · TECHNOLOGY, PRODUCT &amp; AI DUE DILIGENCE</div><div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:#5c5d51">LAST UPDATED {updated}</div></div>
<h1 style="margin:0;font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-weight:300;font-size:clamp(38px,5.4vw,72px);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.025em;max-width:19ch;text-wrap:balance">Diligence on what the business is — and a plan for <em style="color:#8a5a3c">what AI makes it</em>.</h1>
<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:30px;margin-top:40px;align-items:flex-start">
<p style="margin:0;font-size:19px;line-height:1.62;color:#3c3d33;max-width:680px;text-wrap:pretty">Most technical diligence tells you what could go wrong. We cover that properly — then go further, with a costed plan for how AI changes the target's cost base and growth in the first hundred days of ownership. Led by someone who has built, run and sold the kind of business you're buying, with specialist security and data reviewers where the target warrants it.</p>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px 22px;align-items:center;align-self:stretch">
<a href="/contact" style="flex:none;white-space:nowrap;text-decoration:none;background:#15160f;color:#f5f2ea;padding:14px 24px;min-height:48px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;font-size:15px;font-weight:500">Book 30 minutes</a>
<span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:#5c5d51">FIXED QUOTE IN 48 HOURS · IC SESSION INSIDE 3 WEEKS</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div style="padding:clamp(46px,6vw,70px) clamp(20px,4vw,60px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(21,22,15,.14)">
<h2 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-weight:300;font-size:38px;letter-spacing:-.02em">Three strands</h2>
<p style="margin:0 0 36px;font-size:16px;color:#5c5d51;max-width:640px">Commissioned together or separately. Together is better: the AI plan is only credible if it rests on an honest read of the platform and the product.</p>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:24px">
<div style="border:1px solid rgba(21,22,15,.16);padding:34px 30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px"><div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#8a5a3c">TECHNOLOGY</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:27px;line-height:1.15">Is the platform what they say it is?</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#3c3d33">Architecture, code quality, scalability, security and data posture, third-party dependency, and the engineering team — capability, key-person risk, and how they actually ship.</p><div style="margin-top:auto;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid rgba(21,22,15,.14);font-size:14px;color:#5c5d51;line-height:1.6">Answers: what breaks at 3× scale, and what it costs to fix.</div></div>
<div style="border:1px solid rgba(21,22,15,.16);padding:34px 30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px"><div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#8a5a3c">PRODUCT</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:27px;line-height:1.15">Does the product earn the growth story?</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#3c3d33">Usage and retention behind the headline numbers, roadmap realism, competitive position, pricing power, and whether product leadership can take it to the next stage.</p><div style="margin-top:auto;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid rgba(21,22,15,.14);font-size:14px;color:#5c5d51;line-height:1.6">Answers: whether the plan in the model is buildable.</div></div>
<div style="background:#15160f;color:#f5f2ea;padding:34px 30px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px"><div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#d9a27e">AI VALUE CREATION</div><h3 style="margin:0;font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;font-size:27px;line-height:1.15">What does AI make this business worth?</h3><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.62;color:#e4e1d6">A function-by-function plan of attack: where AI takes cost out, where it accelerates revenue, what the data and systems will support, and what it costs to deliver. Plus a hard look at any AI claims the target already makes.</p><div style="margin-top:auto;padding-top:18px;border-top:1px solid rgba(245,242,234,.18);font-size:14px;color:#c5c4b4;line-height:1.6">Answers: the upside you can underwrite, and when it lands.</div></div>
</div>
</div>

<div style="padding:clamp(46px,6vw,70px) clamp(20px,4vw,60px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(21,22,15,.14);background:#eeeade;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:clamp(28px,4vw,60px)">
<div style="max-width:340px"><div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#8a5a3c;margin-bottom:12px">THE NEW ANGLE</div><h2 style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-weight:300;font-size:38px;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.1">AI diligence is a value-creation plan, not a risk register</h2><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#5c5d51">Every buyer now assumes AI is part of the thesis. Very few reach completion knowing where, how much, or how fast. This closes that gap before the price is set.</p></div>
<div style="grid-column:span 2;min-width:0">
{aiPlan.map((a) => (<Fragment>
<div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:56px minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(21,22,15,.18);align-items:start"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:#8a5a3c">{a.n}</span><div><div style="font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-size:23px;margin-bottom:6px">{a.title}</div><div style="font-size:15.5px;color:#3c3d33;line-height:1.6;max-width:680px">{a.body}</div></div></div>
</Fragment>))}
</div>
</div>

<div style="padding:clamp(40px,5vw,56px) clamp(20px,4vw,60px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(21,22,15,.14);background:#15160f;color:#f5f2ea;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px 40px;align-items:center">
<div style="flex:1 1 380px;min-width:0"><div style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#d9a27e;margin-bottom:12px">SAMPLE · REDACTED</div><h2 style="margin:0 0 10px;font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-weight:300;font-size:30px;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.1">See what an AI value-creation plan actually looks like</h2><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#c5c4b4;max-width:560px">A redacted plan from a recent engagement: the opportunity map, the cost-out model in three cases, readiness findings and the first-hundred-days sequence. Twelve pages, PDF.</p></div>
<a href={sampleUrl} style="flex:none;text-decoration:none;border:1px solid rgba(245,242,234,.5);color:#f5f2ea;padding:15px 24px;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:500;white-space:nowrap">Request the sample plan →</a>
</div>
<div style="padding:clamp(46px,6vw,70px) clamp(20px,4vw,60px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(21,22,15,.14);display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:clamp(28px,4vw,60px)">
<div style="max-width:320px"><h2 style="margin:0 0 14px;font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-weight:300;font-size:36px;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.1">How it runs</h2><p style="margin:0;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#5c5d51">Built around your deal timetable.</p></div>
<div style="grid-column:span 2;min-width:0">
{ddSteps.map((s) => (<Fragment>
<div class="r-step" style="display:grid;gap:20px;padding:22px 0;border-top:1px solid rgba(21,22,15,.18);align-items:start"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:12px;color:#8a5a3c">{s.n}</span><div><div style="font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-size:23px;margin-bottom:6px">{s.title}</div><div style="font-size:15.5px;color:#3c3d33;line-height:1.6">{s.body}</div></div><span class="r-time" style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:11.5px;color:#5c5d51;letter-spacing:.1em">{s.time}</span></div>
</Fragment>))}
</div>
</div>

<div style="padding:clamp(46px,6vw,70px) clamp(20px,4vw,60px);border-bottom:1px solid rgba(21,22,15,.14);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:28px 40px;align-items:center;background:#eeeade">
<div><h2 style="margin:0 0 12px;font-family:'Newsreader',Georgia,serif;font-weight:300;font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.02em">The person who writes the plan can deliver it</h2><p style="margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:#3c3d33;max-width:620px">After completion, the AI plan moves straight into a <a href="/ai-operating-partner">retained operating-partner role</a> or an <a href="/embedded-ai-delivery">embedded engagement</a> — no re-briefing, no second firm.</p></div>
<a href="/contact" style="flex:none;text-decoration:none;background:#15160f;color:#f5f2ea;padding:14px 28px;min-height:48px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;font-size:15px;font-weight:500">Book 30 minutes</a>
</div>
</div>
</Base>
